[[The Professor]] gained possession of at least two Undergolems which he attached to the collar of his dog, [[Eathon the dog|Eathon]]. {{Source|The Secret of Two Generations}}

Using [[Araknos]], the Professor hardwired a response to invoke the two Undergolem [[Titans]] into Eathon the dog as a trap for [[Dante Vale|Dante Vale's]] team and other intruders. {{source|The Mission}}

During the raid on [[the Professor's castle]], when [[Lok Lambert]] and [[Sophie Casterwill]] were going to fight the Professor, two Undergolem Titans hiding as statues attacked the remaining Seekers, [[Dante Vale]] and [[Zhalia Moon]]. Zhalia invoked [[King Basilisk]] to fight, but the two colossi easily sent King Basilisk back to its [[Amulet]]. Zhalia then invoked [[Gareon]] and [[Hoplite]], who were likewise be sent back to their Amulets. When [[Dante]] eventually came back to consciousness and invoked [[Caliban]] and [[Metagolem]], his two Titans were able to defeat both Undergolem Titans. {{Source|The Mission}}

When [[Grier]] led the Huntik team to the Professor's Castle to obtain [[Rassimov]]'s file, Eathon the dog, under the care of [[Hoffman]], who is now serving [[Wilder]], invoked his two Undergolem Titans. They fought alongside [[Doberman]] against [[Baselaird|Powerbonded Baselaird]] and [[Megataur]]. One Undergolem was defeated by Baselaird while the other overpowered and defeated Megataur. The remaining Undergolem Titan attacked Baselaird but was thrown back and defeated. {{Source|An Ally from the Organization}}
